{"id":"b2477134b6aa9c7a","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-konig.md","title":"Kőnig Theorem","display":"thm-konig — Kőnig Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-konig","aliases":["58-thm-konig"],"display":"thm-konig — Kőnig Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-konig"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-konig</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-konig — Kőnig Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e4b11a70b933099\" href=\"?note=5e4b11a70b933099\" title=\"../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md\">../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec\\lambda\\in V\">\\(I,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>，且两个基数族以定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的集合函数编码</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in V\">\\(C\\in V\\)</span> 是同时容纳两族值域的集合见证</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用各自的精确上游签名</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,I,C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,I,C)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\vec\\kappa(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\vec\\lambda(i))\n\\land\\vec\\kappa(i)&lt;\\vec\\lambda(i)\n)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\to\\sum_{i\\in I}\\vec\\kappa(i)&lt;\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec\\lambda(i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,I,C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,I,C)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\vec\\kappa(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\vec\\lambda(i))\n\\land\\vec\\kappa(i)&lt;\\vec\\lambda(i)\n)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\to\\sum_{i\\in I}\\vec\\kappa(i)&lt;\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec\\lambda(i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>共同余域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是集合见证；两个索引族不再以未绑定的下标元变量出现，也不把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 传给函数谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e4b11a70b933099","anchor":"ref-3","targetA